      "message": "Most of the pagemap part duplicates `tools/testing/selftests/mm/vm_util.h`: `PM_PRESENT`, `PM_SWAP`, `PM_FILE`, `PM_UFFD_WP`, `PM_MMAP_EXCLUSIVE` and `PM_SOFT_DIRTY` are the same bits, and `pagemap_get_entry()`, `pagemap_is_swapped()` and `pagemap_get_pfn()` cover the same lookups. Every mm test already links them (`$(TEST_GEN_FILES): vm_util.c`).\n\nSince all users of these readers are mm tests, could they reuse `vm_util.h` (with a page size argument added where a test reads a pagemap of the other geometry)? This top-level header would then keep only the generic re-exec helpers.",
